### 1. Root Route
GET http://localhost:3000/

###

### 2. About Route
GET http://localhost:3000/about/

###

### 3. Retrieve All Books (Default 10, Sorted by title ASC)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

###

### 4. Search Books by Title Substring (?search_q=harry)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=harry

###

### 5. Search Books by Title Substring (?search_q=the)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=the

###

### 6. Sort Books by Price Descending (?order_by=price&order=DESC)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC

###

### 7. Filter Books by Price Range (?min_price=400&max_price=600)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?min_price=400&max_price=600

###

### 8. Pagination (?limit=5&offset=0 - First 5 books)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?limit=5&offset=0

###

### 9. Retrieve a Single Book by ID (GET /books/1/)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

###

### 10. Add a New Book (POST /books/)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Power of Habit",
  "author": "Charles Duhigg",
  "price": 420,
  "pages": 371
}

###

### 11. Update an Existing Book (PUT /books/:bookId/)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/2/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Atomic Habits (Updated Edition)",
  "author": "James Clear",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": 350
}

###

### 12. Delete a Book by ID (DELETE /books/:bookId/)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/1/

###

### 13. Verify Deletion (GET /books/1/ -> Expected 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

###

### 14. Validation Test: Invalid order_by value (?order_by=rating -> Expected 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=rating

###

### 15. Validation Test: Invalid sorting order (?order=RANDOM -> Expected 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order=RANDOM

###

### 16. Validation Test: Invalid POST data (missing author -> Expected 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete Book",
  "price": 350
}

###

### 17. Validation Test: Invalid price in POST (string instead of number -> Expected 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "price": "not_a_number",
  "pages": 200
}

###

### 18. Validation Test: PUT non-existent book ID (PUT /books/999/ -> Expected 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/999/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Book",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": 150
}

###

### 19. Validation Test: DELETE non-existent book ID (DELETE /books/999/ -> Expected 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/999/
